xible, sustainable\nsolutions for device turnover.\n\nMore about Buyback ][26] [\nRefurbished\n\nOur expertly restored devices undergo rigorous testing on 55 quality indicators and come with a\nwarranty of up to 24 months.\n\nCustomers enjoy a great price, and stores benefit from high margins. Each device arrives in stylish,\neco-friendly packaging.\n\nMore about Refurbished ][27]\n[\nTrade-In Your Device\n\nYour used gadget is a valuable asset! Upgrade to a new one at any of our 4,500+ partner stores.\nEnjoy a free assessment in under 10 minutes and apply your trade-in value instantly toward your next\ndevice.\n* Cover up to 99% of new purchases.\n* Buy your new gadget and trade in the old one, all in one place.\n* Trade in your old phone hassle-free.\n* Upgrade more frequently to the latest devices.\n\nMore about Trade-in ][28] [\nRefurbished devices\n\nRefurbished have undergone a complete restoration to 100% functionality at our production facility\nin Poland, which has three international certifications. These gadgets work, look, and have a\nwarranty like new, but up to 30% cheaper and up to 87% safer for the environment.\n* Warranty up to 24 months\n* Tested on 55+ indicators\n* Test certificate for each device\n* ISO certification production in Europe\n\nMore about Refurbished ][29]\n\n## Breezy in numbers\n\n0\nCountries\nof operations\n0\n\n+\n\nTrade-in partners authorized Apple, Samsung, Xiaomi resellers\n0\n\n+\n\nStores within our partners’ network\n0\n\n+\n\nEmployees committed to a circular economy\n0\n\n+\n\nProduction areas in Poland, Ukraine and Kazakhstan\n\n### We make device reuse\n### a lifestyle choice\n\n### For you and the planet\n\nFor a customer or business, one device or a thousand, we help everyone benefit from going circular.\n\n### We manage the lifecycle of used devices\n\nBy buyback of devices businesses no longer need. And by trade-in solution for:\n* Retailers\n* Telecom operators\n* E-commerce\n* Marketplaces\n\n### We bring devices back to market at an attractive price\n\nEach device is graded and upgraded in our ISO-certified facility before returning to use. This\nextends the lifespan of electronics, supporting a circular economy and [sustainability][30]\n* **Less:**\n* CO₂ emissions\n* E-waste\n* Soil and water pollution\n* **More:**\n* Tech affordability\n* Added value for businesses\n* Sustainable practices\n\nOur advantages\nDriving Growth,\nEfficiency, and Impact\n\n### $50 million\n\nReap the benefits\nOur products generate an additional $50 million in revenue for our customers each year.\n\n### X3\n\nSave time\nOur customers have reduced the time spent on operations with old equipment by three times.\n\n### CSR\n\nStrengthen your brand\nBecome a preferred brand for employees and customers through CSR.\n\n### 20K tons\n\nProtecting the environment\nWe gave a second life to 300K devices and reduced CO2 emissions by 20K tons.\nTestimonials\n\n## We develop every solution with our clients in mind\n\n[ See more reviews ][31]\n\nBreezy demonstrated true customer focus and flexibility in providing non-standard solutions. We were\ndelighted with how Breezy organized the entire process – it was convenient and simple for us. I’ve\nsince recommended Breezy to my colleagues in other countries as a trusted partner for equipment\nbuyback\n\nGave old equipment a second life while boosting employee loyalty\n[ Case study ][32]\nIrina Prisacari Administrative Manager Bayer Moldova\n* EOM\n\nOur partnership with Breezy marks an important phase in our development in Kazakhstan, offering\nlocal consumers a fantastic opportunity to engage with HONOR’s technology. This offer is a perfect\nmatch both to new customers considering their first HONOR smartphone and to existing users looking\nto upgrade to the latest model\n\nHigher customer satisfaction\n[ Case study ][33]\nJonibek Wei Regional Director of HONOR\n* Mobile Operator\n\nDeveloped by Breezy’s team, the online trade-in solution is easily integrated with our e-commerce\nplatform. It allows us to offer customers the best deals based on Trade-in value while demonstrating\ncare for the environment and customers\n\nfirst in Kazakhstan trade-in online with instant discount\n#1 first in Kazakhstan trade-in online with instant discount [ Case study ][34]\nVictoriya Novichkova CEO of Freedom Mobile\n* distributor\n\nThe buyback service provided by our long-term partner Breezy is a handy and effective tool for\nincreasing sales for distributors and integrators. This service also assists official distributors\nin competing with ‘gray market’ goods while maintaining competitive pricing\n\nan effective tool in competing with ‘gray market’\n[ Case study ][35]\nConstantin Diurici General Manager at ASBC Moldova\n* FMCG Distributor\n\nThe buyback by Breezy is a great example of effective business practices. It’s a triple win for the\ncompany: you can write off old equipment from the balance sheet without any hassle, purchase new\ndevices more profitably, and follow sustainable development principles\n\nequipment purchase for its Moldova team using used devices\nх2 equipment purchase for its Moldova team using used devices [ Case study ][36]\nEugen Ursu Senior Buyer at Coca-Cola HBC Moldova\n* Retailer\n\nPartnership with Breezy allowed us to offer our customers the highest possible quality Trade-in\nexperience in Georgia. Through their innovative solutions, we seamlessly integrated their services\nin B2C, E-Com, and B2B parts of our business, saving time for retail customers and helping business\npartners transform their IT fleets conveniently.\n\n[ Read full review ][37]\nAnzori Lomidze General Manager iSpace Georgia\n* Retailer\n\nThanks to introducing the Trade-In by Breezy to our stores we solved two client’s problems at once:\nhow to sell their old gadget and when to do it.\n\nIncrease the customer satisfaction\n[ Case study ][38]\nIrina Chelpanova Head of Digital Services Business at Comfy\n* Retailer\n\nTrade-in online by Breezy is a convenient and fast way to upgrade a gadget. The service allows\ncustomers to easily get the value of their used device and complete the transaction without leaving\nhome\n\nTrade-in attach rate growth\n+30% Trade-in attach rate growth [ Case study ][39]\nDmitry Provkin CEO at Sulpak\n* Retailer\n\nAt Technodom, we prioritize customer convenience. Therefore, it was important that the Trade-in\nservice looks as natural as possible in our online store and works seamlessly. Our IT team conducted\nnumerous tests with Breezy’s developers to achieve the perfect process for the customer. We are\nsatisfied with how the service works and expect our customers to appreciate it and use it frequently\n\nTrade-in attach rate growth within the first month of implementation\n+30% Trade-in attach rate growth within the first month of implementation [ Case study ][40]\nRenat Ismailov CEO of Technodom\n* Retailer\n\nWe were satisfied with Breezy’s response to our comments, how quickly and with what readiness they\nmade changes to the process. Trade-in is an experience that we are constantly expanding with our top\npartner. With such synergy, creating innovative projects for clients is much easier and more\nenjoyable\n\nAttachment Rate, when every sixth promotional item was sold in exchange for a used gadget\n15% Attachment Rate, when every sixth promotional item was sold in exchange for a used gadget [ Case\nstudy ][41]\nRuslan Doroshenko Head of Additional Services Development and Management Department\n[ See more reviews ][42]\nMedia write about us\nHow businesses can enhance customer experience: Insights from Freedom, Technodom, and Sulpak on a\nnew online service\n\n27.11.2024\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][43]\nForbes Ukraine unveiled a rating of e-commerce leaders. A special place in the magazine was given to\nniche champions. Breezy is one of them.\n\n07.04.2024\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][44]\nHow to exchange an old gadget for a brand new iPhone 14? Our editorial team decided to take a closer\nlook at trade-in\n\n14.03.2023\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][45]\nBreezy, a subsidiary of the ASBIS Group specialising in the refurbishment and remarketing of\nsecond-life IT products, has unveiled a cutting-edge facility in Raszyn, Poland.\n\n06.02.2025\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][46]\nAndrii Kosar, CEO of Breezy, on 5 things you need to be a highly effective C-Level Leader of a\nretail tech company in an interview with Kieran Powell\n\n23.01.2024\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][47]\nBreezy sees 60% boost in sales Apple iPhone 16 using trade-in as an incentive\n\n08.11.2024\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][48]\nBreezy launches AI-powered robotic line in Poland for grading and upgrading pre-owned smartphones\n\n04.02.2025\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][49]\nBreezy Launches Ai-Powered Robotic Line in Poland for Grading and Upgrading Pre-Owned Smartphones\n\n04.02.2025\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][50]\nMiMarkt, an authorized Xiaomi reseller, is launching a used smartphone trade-in program in all of\nits stores. The program is the result of MiMarkt’s partnership with Breezy.\n\n15.06.2023\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][51]\nBreezy, a subsidiary of Asbis Enterprises specializing in smartphone refurbishment, has signed a\ncooperation agreement with the RTV Euro AGD chain\n\n16.09.2024\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][52]\nBreezy from the Asbis Group launches a robotic production line in Poland\n\n04.02.2025\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][53]\nYou visit a Xiaomi store, trade in your old smartphone, and receive a discount on a new one. Breezy\nis the official partner of the program.\n\n15.06.2023\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][54]\nMoldcell launches the Trade-In program powered by Breezy. Exchange your old gadget and receive a\nfavorable discount for a new one\n\n16.06.2023\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][55]\nNow, Moldcell customers have the opportunity to trade-in their old device for a discount to purchase\na new device or gadget on the most favorable terms.\n\n16.06.2023\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][56]\nWas it possible? Lifehack for those who want a new iPhone\n\n12.07.2022\n\nCategory:Media\n\n[ Read article ][57]\nHow electronics chains use Trade-In to boost sales during a market downturn: Breezy analytics\n\n15.03.2023\n\nCategory:Media"
