esearch and have built several specializations within this.\n\nLearn more\n\n##### Categories\n\nChannel Development\nChannel Management\nCompetitor Strategy\nCustomised Data\nMarket Entry\nMarketing Solutions\nPartner Programs\nSpeaking Engagements\n\nGet best in class analysis, go-to-market strategies and more for cloud, infrastructure and\ncybersecurity channels.\n\n##### Categories\n\nCloud Channels Analysis\nInfrastructure Analysis\nCybersecurity Analysis\n\nAlys offers vendors a high-value method to evaluate channel partners at scale and engage with them\ndigitally. Vendors can assess the channel’s capabilities and nurture partners to grow. After decades\nof experience working with vendors’ partner teams, Canalys understands the strategic challenges\nfacing channel leaders.\n\nLearn more\n\nGet comprehensive data to track smart vehicles and stay up to date on the key trends affecting the\nautomotive industry.\n\n##### Categories\n\nIntelligent Vehicle Analysis\n\n##### Select language\n\nEnglish 中文 日本語 한국어 ไทย Bahasa Indonesia Español Português Deutsch Français\n\n* the site will be machine translated\n\nExpertise that listens.\nAdvice that leads.\n\nWe are now Omdia, a leading technology research and advisory group.\n\nFrom R&D to ROI, we identify the most promising opportunities to drive the industry forward.\n\n# Canalys is now Omdia\n\nWith expertise around the world and comprehensive coverage of the tech domains, we bring you the\nbreadth to see the big picture and the depth to act decisively.\n\nTogether, we shape global markets\n\nWe have now moved to Omdia.com where you can find our blogs, insights and press releases. The way\nyou access your research remains the same.\n\n[ Go to your content ][39]\n\n## Learn more\n\n[Your Content]\n\n##### Your Content\n\nWe have now moved to Omdia.com but the way you access your research and your login details remain\nthe same.\n\n[ Log In ][40]\n[Support]\n\n##### Support\n\nContact us to explore opportunities, ser