ing looking at a tablet screen with a chart]\n\n## Products\n\nWe gain insights by understanding our customers’ needs and use our technical expertise to tailor\nsolutions to help maximize their market advantage moving forward.\n\n[OUR PRODUCTS][178]\n\n## Sustainability\n\nSustainability is a vital part of our core business strategy. We're making sure we understand the\nmegatrends that will impact on our lives in the years to come.\n\n[LATEST SUSTAINABILITY REPORTING][179]\n[Two]\n\n## Investors\n\nWe’re committed to long-term investments and business partnerships, by harnessing innovation,\nlearning and operational excellence.\n\n[INVESTORS][180]\n\n## CAREERS\n\nPeople have helped us to develop, produce and market innovative solutions that make a difference\nboth to industry and to humanity. At SABIC we enable you to realize your ideas and make an impact.\n\n[VIEW JOB OPPORTUNITIES][181]\n[Three people looking at a whiteboard]\n[\n][182]\n\n## Our Brand\n\nWe believe the answer to some of the world's biggest challenges lies in the natural human instinct\nto collaborate. Together we're making Chemistry that Matters™.\n\n[Our Brand][183]\n\n## Our Stories\n\nFor over 45 years, our ambition to define the future of petrochemicals has yielded solutions for the\nchallenges of today and helped our customers achieve their ambitions for a better tomorrow. We are\nmaking a meaningful impact in the world and delivering Chemistry that Matters™.\n\n[Read our stories][184]\n\n## LATEST NEWS\n\n[\n[SABIC’S]\n][185]\n[\n\n### SABIC’S New LNP™ Thermocomp™ OFM Compounds Help Enable High-Voltage Power Modules\n\n][186]\n[\n[laptop]\n][187]\n[\n\n### SABIC LAUNCHES NOVEL PCR-BASED LNP™ ELCRIN™ COMPOUND WITH ENHANCED PERFORMANCE\n\n][188]\n[\n[Battery]\n][189]\n[\n\n### SABIC showcases at the battery show Europe its full EV battery material ecosystem for higher\n### performance from pack to power components\n\n][190]\n\n[LATEST NEWS][191]\n\nCompare up to 4 grades\n\nYou already have 