 order, you can count on it arriving where and when you need it.\n\n##### Consistent quantities at competitive prices. (Because we hate surprises as much as you do.)\n\nOur inventory is sourced directly from top phone carriers and manufacturers. By cutting out the\nmiddleman, we can ensure consistent quantities and competitive prices, which means higher profits\nfor you.\n\n##### Responsive reps that never keep you waiting for answers.\n\nOur customer service team will always keep you updated about the status of your order and resolve\nissues quickly in the rare case that something doesn’t go as planned. Got questions? We respond to\nall inquiries within the same business day.\n\n##### We’re not just a supplier; we’re a strategic partner.\n\nWe take the time to learn about your business and offer creative solutions to help you grow—whether\nit’s expanding your product line, keeping you informed about emerging market trends, or extending a\ncredit line to help your cash flow.\n[Work with us][19]\n\n#### FEATURES & BENEFITS\n\n# The Quality and Service You Expect, Without the Headaches You Hate\n\nOrders shipped **within one business day**. Drop shipping available.\n\nEach unit **sanitized, data-wiped, & graded** to the strictest industry standards.\nKitting solutions and** customized packaging** upon request.\n\n**24-hour RMA response** in the event that you’re not happy with your order.\n\nOur 100,000 sq. ft. facility houses **large** **quantities of inventory** ready to ship.\n\nOur **team is on call** to answer your questions within one business day.\n\n### Maintaining the Highest Quality and Environmental Standards Since 2000\n\n## Ready to Power Up Your Profits?\n\nWe help you do it in four simple steps:\n\n### **We get to know you**\n\nWe’ll start with a brief conversation to learn about your business and send you a simple application\nto get started.\n\n### **You pick your stock**\n\nOnce your application is accepted, we’ll send you a stock list that suits your needs, so you can\nbrowse prices and inventory.\n\n### **You place an order**\n\nAfter placing an order, your devices will be shipped within 24 hours. We’ll always follow up to\nensure you received your order.\n\n### **We help you grow**\n\nAs your strategic partner, we take a hands-on approach, offering guidance & solutions to help you\ngrow your business.\n\n# **Let’s Get Started!**\n\n[Work with us][20]\n[[USMP US Mobile Phones]][21]\n* [Home][22]\n* [About us][23]\n* [Services][24]\n* [How it works][25]\n* [Contact][26]\n* [Home][27]\n* [About us][28]\n* [Services][29]\n* [How it works][30]\n* [Contact][31]\n* [Follow][32]\n* [Follow][33]\n* [Follow][34]\n\n©️ 2022 U.S. Mobile Phones, Inc. Designed and developed by [Purple Pixel Design Group][35].\nCopywriting by **Show Me The Copy, Inc**.\n\n[+1 (844) 723-8600 ][36]   |   [info@usmphones.com][37]\nUS Mobile Phones Inc. New Jersey HQ 502 Jersey Ave. New Brunswick, NJ 08901\n* [Follow][38]\n* [Follow][39]\n* [Follow][40]\n\n[+1 (844) 723-8600 ][41]   |   [info@usmphones.com][42]\nUS Mobile Phones Inc. New Jersey HQ 502 Jersey Ave. New Brunswick, NJ 08901\nUS Mobile Phones Miami Offices: 8274 NW 70th street, Miami FL 33166\n\n©️ 2020 U.S. Mobile Phones, Inc. Designed and developed by [Purple Pixel Design Group][43].\nCopywriting by **Show Me The Copy, Inc**.\n\n[1]: https://wa.me/19088453844\n[2]: https://wa.me/19088453844\n[3]: https://usmphones.com/\n[4]: https://usmphones.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://usmphones.com/our-services/\n[6]: https://usmphones.com/our-process/\n[7]: https://usmphones.com/for-suppliers/\n[8]: https://usmphones.com/contact/\n[9]: https://usmphones.com/about-us/\n[10]: https://usmphones.com/our-services/\n[11]: https://usmphones.com/our-process/\n[12]: https://usmphones.com/for-suppliers/\n[13]: https://usmphones.com/contact/\n[14]: https://usmphones.com/\n[15]: https://usmphones.com/contact/\n[16]: https://usmphones.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/smartphone-slider1.png\n[17]: https://usm